        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "When you are under close scrutiny, you might choose to observe all these optional rules. Ordinarily, though, most careful writers follow them selectively, which is to say they are not rules at all but rather stylistic choices that create a formal tone. If you adopt the worst-case approach and observe them all, all the time, few readers will give you credit, but many will notice how formal, perhaps even stiff, your writing seems.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                889,
                772,
                1044
            ],
            "block_id": 17,
